## Project Structure
```
{{ name }}/
├── {{ name }}/           # Main package
│   ├── config.py        # Configuration (Pydantic + YAML)
{% if has_fastapi %}
│   ├── app.py           # FastAPI application
│   ├── controllers/     # API routes
│   └── middleware/      # HTTP middleware
{% elif has_aiogram %}
│   ├── main.py          # Bot entry point
│   ├── controllers/     # Message handlers
│   └── middlewares/     # Bot middlewares
{% else %}
│   └── main.py          # Entry point
{% endif %}
{% if has_sqlalchemy %}
│   ├── db/              # Database layer
│   │   ├── base.py      # SQLAlchemy base
│   │   ├── types.py     # Custom types (uuid_pk, etc.)
│   │   ├── mixin.py     # Mixins (CreatedAt, UpdatedAt)
│   │   └── models/      # Database models
│   └── ext/sqlalchemy/  # SQLAlchemy extensions
{% endif %}
{% if has_redis %}
│   └── db/redis.py      # Redis connection
{% endif %}
├── config/              # Configuration files
├── Taskfile.yaml        # Task runner commands
└── docker-compose.yaml  # Docker services
```

## Commands
- `task run` - Run the application
- `task build` - Build Docker image
- `task up` - Start all services
- `task down` - Stop all services
- `task lint` - Run linters
- `task format` - Format code
- `task ipython` - Interactive shell
{% if has_sqlalchemy %}
- `task db:revision` - Create migration
- `task db:upgrade` - Run migrations
- `task db:downgrade` - Rollback migration
{% endif %}
{% if has_redis %}
- `task redis:cli` - Redis CLI
{% endif %}

## Configuration
Configuration is loaded from `config/local.yaml`. Copy `config/local.yaml.example` as a starting point.

